{"title":"ObjectTwin: Training-Free Asset Verification for Captured Scenes","subtitle":"Capture-conditioned asset verification from partial observations","repoUrl":"https://github.com/StyoKuok/sim_ready","paperUrl":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.35904","projectUrl":"https://styokuok.github.io/sim_ready/","abstract":"ObjectTwin is a training-free framework for capture-conditioned asset verification. It checks observed surfaces and known free space across compatible alignments, separates relative choice from absolute quality, and evaluates fixed decisions using held-out observations. The expanded manuscript is available as arXiv v2.","humanInLoopNote":"Recorded human yaw edits belong to the interactive workflow archive. They do not enter the frozen-view representation comparisons.","scenes":[{"scene_id":"room0","title":"Replica room0","human_preview":"data/previews/hitl_room0.png","human_orbit_poster":"data/posters/hitl_room0.jpg","human_orbit_mp4":"data/orbits/hitl/room0/orbit.mp4","human_orbit_gif":"data/orbits/hitl/room0/orbit.gif","orbit_status":"ready","auto_preview":"data/previews/auto_room0.png","auto_compose_method":"global_loop_v2 (VLM-independent subset)","metrics":{"n_instances":13,"n_kept":13,"n_vlm_filtered":22}},{"scene_id":"room1","title":"Replica room1","human_preview":"data/previews/hitl_room1.png","human_orbit_poster":"data/posters/hitl_room1.jpg","human_orbit_mp4":"data/orbits/hitl/room1/orbit.mp4","human_orbit_gif":"data/orbits/hitl/room1/orbit.gif","orbit_status":"ready","auto_preview":"data/previews/auto_room1.png","auto_compose_method":"gt_obb_pca","metrics":{"n_instances":11,"n_kept":11,"n_vlm_filtered":14}},{"scene_id":"room2","title":"Replica room2","human_preview":"data/previews/hitl_room2.png","human_orbit_poster":"data/posters/hitl_room2.jpg","human_orbit_mp4":"data/orbits/hitl/room2/orbit.mp4","human_orbit_gif":"data/orbits/hitl/room2/orbit.gif","orbit_status":"ready","auto_preview":"data/previews/auto_room2.png","auto_compose_method":"gt_ob