efine.","finetune":"Compose policy stacks (E0–E5) on gt_pca — preview PNG only, no composed GLB orbit."},"interpretation":{"dyaw_deg":"|Δyaw| > 10° → visible orientation change; primary metric for yaw ablations.","dscale":"|Δscale| > 0.05 → noticeable size mismatch vs baseline.","dx_dz":"Floor-plane shift in meters; |Δ| > 0.05 m → layout moved on X/Z.","zero":"All Δ ≈ 0 → method agrees with baseline on that instance."},"delta_title":"Pose difference vs baseline (gt_obb_pca)","columns":{"instance_id":"Furniture instance ID in Replica office2 (same IDs for every method).","dyaw_deg":"Yaw change in degrees: method − baseline. CCW about vertical +Y (bird's-eye). +15 = turned 15° left vs baseline.","dscale":"Uniform scale change: method − baseline. +0.05 = 5% larger.","dx":"East–west shift (m) in Replica world frame: method − baseline.","dz":"North–south shift (m) in Replica world frame: method − baseline."},"absolute_title":"Absolute poses for this method (Replica world frame, Y-up)","absolute_columns":{"x":"Instance centroid X (meters)","y":"Height Y (meters)","z":"Instance centroid Z (meters)","yaw_deg":"Heading angle CCW about +Y (degrees, top-down)","scale":"Uniform mesh scale factor at compose time","layout_pose_source":"Tag in fp_manifest recording which sub-pipeline set this pose"},"baseline_note":"★ Baseline gt_obb_pca = scan centroid + OBB footprint + PCA yaw (fp_manifest_gt_pca_fix.json). Sim-Ready best automatic compose. Every Δ row = selected method minus this baseline."},"methods":[{"id":"gt_obb_pca","status":"ok","title":"GT OBB + PCA yaw","category":"baseline","preview":"data/previews/ablation/gt_obb_pca.png","orbit_poster":"data/posters/gt_obb_pca.jpg","orbit_gif":"data/orbits/ablation/gt_obb_pca/orbit.gif","orbit_mp4":"data/orbits/ablation/gt_obb_pca/orbit.mp4","orbit_status":"ready","note":"GT centroid+PCA yaw (auto best baseline)"},{"id":"tripo_layout","status":"ok","title":"Tripo depth / COLMAP layout","category":"baseline","preview":"data/previews/a